{'symbol': 'ALL', 'date': '2023-02-16 08:25:00', 'title': 'ALLSTATE ANNOUNCES JANUARY 2023 CATASTROPHE LOSSES AND IMPLEMENTED AUTO RATES', 'text': 'NORTHBROOK, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE ALLSTATE CORPORATION (NYSE: ALL) TODAY ANNOUNCED ESTIMATED CATASTROPHE LOSSES FOR THE MONTH OF JANUARY OF $307 MILLION OR $243 MILLION, AFTER-TAX. CATASTROPHE LOSSES FOR JANUARY EVENTS WERE ESTIMATED AT $309 MILLION, RELATED TO NINE EVENTS PRIMARILY IN TEXAS AND CALIFORNIA, PARTIALLY OFFSET BY FAVORABLE RESERVE REESTIMATES FOR PRIOR EVENTS.'}